  "question": {
    "text": "The range of the projectile projected at an angle of $15^{\\circ}$ with horizontal is 50 m . If the projectile is projected with same velocity at an angle of $45^{\\circ}$ with horizontal, then its range will be :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "50 m",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$50 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{~m}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "100 m",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$100 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{~m}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Range of projectile\n$R=\\frac{v^2 \\sin 2 \\theta}{g}(\\because R \\propto \\sin (2 \\theta))$\n$\\frac{R_1}{R_2}=\\frac{\\sin \\left(2 \\theta_1\\right)}{\\sin \\left(2 \\theta_2\\right)}=\\frac{\\sin (2 \\times 15)}{\\sin (2 \\times 45)}=\\frac{\\sin 30^{\\circ}}{\\sin 90^{\\circ}}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{50}{\\mathrm{R}_2}=\\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{R}_2=100 \\mathrm{~m}$"
  }
}